# Developer-tools switch: this file defines EORZEA_ARSENAL_DEVTOOLS and compiles the developer
# surfaces in. It must never be committed — CI refuses a checkout that contains it. The committed
# copy is Directory.Build.local.props.example.
Directory.Build.local.props

# The custom-repo index, which is build output and not source. The release workflow generates it from
# the *built* manifest at tag time and attaches it to the release, and that attachment is what players
# point Dalamud at. A committed copy is read by nobody and goes stale the moment a version ships: the
# one here sat at 0.4.0.0 through two releases.
pluginmaster.json
